    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, our favor configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability. our can propose cost-efficient tiers and models, such as the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, which are more cost-efficient on the recurring side compared to the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference. our finance role works closely with the architect to keep the proposed configuration within the budget envelope while preserving an acceptable margin." ;
