    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: provision of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, improvement of efficiency for CHRB staff, improvement of quality and safety of care delivered to patients, reduction of complexity of procedures for staff, simplification of access to information sources for staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the AI components and innovation strategy for this tender response, considering we LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, we will leverage we Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities to design an AI assistance solution that enhances hospital staff efficiency while improving patient care quality and safety. we approach will build on past successful deployments, such as the medical-documentation pilot for a regional hospital group." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we will utilize we hybrid retrieval approach, combining lexical and semantic search, to provide staff with rapid access to relevant information sources, including care protocols, internal procedures, and regulatory texts. utilize will simplify staff workflow by reducing the time spent searching for necessary information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve efficiency, we will implement template-guided drafting for clinical notes and discharge summaries, allowing staff to quickly generate high-quality documents while ensuring compliance with institutional rules and protocols. we system will also offer action and verification suggestions based on the context of each patient's dossier, streamlining decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explainability is crucial in healthcare; thus, we solution will incorporate source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval traces for every interaction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This transparency, combined with human oversight built into the workflow, aligns with HAS guidance and ensures that AI-driven suggestions are validated by professionals before implementation. we will fine-tune we model on client-specific material to enhance performance while adhering to defined data use terms agreed upon with the client and we compliance function. we iterative approach involves corpus selection and curation with client experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to ensure high-quality outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Performance will be measured using a labelled evaluation set built in collaboration with the client, focusing on metrics such as groundedness, relevance, and factual support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that our solution meets the required standards of quality and safety." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By embedding we AI assistant into existing clinical and administrative workflows without introducing significant disruptions, we aim to reduce processing and documentation times. we past deployments have demonstrated the potential for such efficiency gains, and we believe a similar approach can benefit CHRB staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, we strategy balances performance with explainability and sovereignty, recognizing the trade-offs involved in model selection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing the right model option per engagement, whether it be we sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models via API, we can tailor we solution to meet the specific needs of the client while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and internal standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: limitation of environmental footprint of the authority's information systems, reliance on low-carbon infrastructure, contribution to reducing energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that we proposed solution meets : limitation of environmental footprint of the authority's information systems, reliance on low-carbon infrastructure, contribution to reducing energy consumption, considering we EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs? we can meet The client sustainability requirements by leveraging we existing capabilities. we EcoVadis Silver rating demonstrates we commitment to CSR and sustainability. we have conducted a bilan carbone and published a trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, which will help limit the environmental footprint of the authority's information systems.  we partnership with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud, who use renewable energy and have a low power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, ensures reliance on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we sovereign European model self-hosted capability allows for data sovereignty while minimizing carbon footprint. we also practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which contribute to reducing energy consumption. we carbon reporting capability enables transparency in tracking and managing the carbon footprint of we solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we social commitments and AI ethics principles are not directly related to environmental sustainability, our social commitments and AI ethics principles demonstrate we overall commitment to responsible business practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding known sustainability trade-offs, we acknowledge the tension between high availability and energy consumption, but we explicitly present the associated footprint of premium configurations to ensure informed decision-making." ;
