        ex:hasText "By combining these strengths, we can propose a solution that effectively addresses the client's sustainability requirements and reduces the environmental footprint of the client's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) can rely on our consortium to design, implement, and deploy an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities. our proposal is built around our Atelier platform, a sovereign document-grounded AI assistant, which can be tailored to meet the requirements of improving efficiency, quality, and safety of care, as well as reducing complexity and administrative work for The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) staff. our hybrid delivery model combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, ensuring that an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities meets the client's requirements and constraints while maintaining decision traceability. our will start by framing the project, defining the scope, goals, and deliverables in collaboration with the client's through our joint steering committee. our dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client's to understand the client's specific needs and priorities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Atelier platform provides hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities may notably cover retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation; assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents; support in handling dossiers (admissions, coding, medico-social pathways, etc.); and support for the continuity of care between professionals, shifts, and services. an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities meets the client's technical requirements, including response times below 2 seconds for common queries, API integration with the client's existing information systems and user directories, and hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU. our offer hosting on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only, ensuring that data is hosted exclusively within the EU. our implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256, as well as pseudonymisation of sensitive data where relevant. our data protection measures also include strict isolation between client corpora, per-engagement logical separation, role-based access control, audit logging, and configurable retention." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our have a Data Protection Officer appointed and maintain a data processing register. an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities is designed to be explainable, allowing for human oversight and validation by qualified professionals. our will utilize our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities to provide staff with rapid access to relevant information sources, including care protocols, internal procedures, and regulatory texts. our system will also offer action and verification suggestions based on the context of each patient's dossier, streamlining decision-making processes. our are committed to reducing the environmental footprint of the authority's information systems. our EcoVadis Silver rating demonstrates our commitment to CSR and sustainability. our have conducted a bilan carbone and published a trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year. our partnership with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud's, who use renewable energy and have a low power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, ensures reliance on low-carbon infrastructure. an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities is aligned with the client's budget constraints, with a global budget allocated to the project estimated at €900,000 over 5 years. our aim to maintain a gross margin within our target range of 25-35 percent, while ensuring that our pricing remains competitive and aligned with the client's budgetary capacity. our believe that an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities meets the client's requirements and constraints, while maintaining transparency and accountability throughout the project. our approach balances performance with explainability and sovereignty, recognizing the trade-offs involved in model selection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing the right model option per engagement, whether it be our sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models via API, our can tailor an artificial intelligence solution that assists hospital staff in their daily activities to meet the specific needs of the client while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and internal standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ultimately, Our proposal aims to provide a comprehensive AI assistance solution that enhances hospital staff efficiency while improving patient care quality and safety. our are confident that our consortium has the expertise and capabilities to deliver a solution that meets the client's requirements and contributes to reducing the environmental footprint of the client's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

