        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The present contract covers the design, implementation and deployment of such a solution. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress patient pathway, and an efficient resumption of handling by another professional. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints 4.1 Personal and health data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must guarantee strict compliance with the GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Health data is processed as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9) and medical confidentiality (secret médical) must be preserved." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Data must be hosted exclusively within the European Union; no transfer of data outside the European Union is authorised; sensitive data must be appropriately protected (encryption, pseudonymisation where relevant). 4.2 Health-data hosting (HDS)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution must provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities may notably cover: retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols and applicable regulation; assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents; support in handling dossiers (admissions, coding, medico-social pathways, etc.); support for the continuity of care between professionals, shifts and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The infrastructure hosting The solution must hold the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification. 4.3 Explainability and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Recommendations or suggestions produced by The solution must be explainable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It must be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements that led to an output (source grounding, audit trail), consistent with HAS guidance on the use of AI in healthcare. 4.4 Medical responsibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be designed as an assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be positioned so as not to require medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR); should any use case approach medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR), the bidder must explicitly address the implications. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide response times compatible with daily clinical use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As an indication, a response time below 2 seconds is expected for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of answer relevance is expected. 5.2 Availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must fit into the existing practices of staff and must not introduce a rupture in clinical or administrative workflows. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Continuity of care requires a high level of availability, including outside office hours (24/7 services)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An availability target of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration and interoperability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and the electronic patient record (DPI)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), the national health identifier (INS), and the national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé / DMP)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API-type interfaces are expected, as is integration with user directories. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the authority's attaches particular importance to data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be performed on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent, and particular attention will be paid to dependency on non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budget constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual operating cost must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope 3.1 Information consultation assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints As part of the authority's sustainable-development policy, the authority's wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the authority's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Deployment terms the project must be conducted progressively, with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) followed by progressive generalisation to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Change-management support and staff training are expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Evaluation criteria Offers will be evaluated against the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution; compliance with regulatory requirements; level of security; data sovereignty; quality of integration with the existing SIH/DPI; total cost of the proposed solution; consideration of environmental issues; capacity for innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires: implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, improvement of efficiency for CHRB staff, improvement of quality and safety of care delivered to patients, reduction of complexity of procedures for staff, simplification of access to information sources for staff, decrease of administrative and documentation work for staff, increase of time available for patient care for staff, facilitation of access to information for CHRB staff, improvement of quality of written outputs for CHRB staff, reduction of processing and documentation times for CHRB staff, assistance in daily activities for CHRB staff, provision of an intelligent assistance tool for hospital staff with a must priority, retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation with a may priority, assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents with a may priority, support in handling dossiers with a may priority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, how can our company's ensure that an AI assistance solution for hospital staff meets these requirements and constraints while maintaining decision traceability?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure an AI assistance solution for hospital staff meets The client requirements and constraints while maintaining decision traceability, our company's will apply our company's hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. our company's will start by framing the project, defining the scope, goals, and deliverables in collaboration with The client through our company's joint steering committee." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past references, particularly the regional hospital group pilot assistant for medical documentation, our company's can leverage this experience to inform our company's solution design. our company's partnership with Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator, will also be crucial in ensuring SIH/DPI integration and FHIR/INS interoperability. our company's dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with the client to understand the client specific needs and priorities. our company's will allocate our company's available capacity efficiently, considering our company's concurrent public health engagements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout the project, our company's will maintain a RACI matrix to ensure clear roles and responsibilities and make decisions through our company's operational committee, which meets fortnightly. our company's single point of contact, the project director, will be responsible for ensuring that all stakeholders are informed and aligned. our company's will prioritize the implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, focusing on improving efficiency, quality, and safety of care, as well as reducing complexity and administrative work for CHRB staff. our company's Atelier platform, a sovereign document-grounded AI assistant, can be tailored to meet these requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

